  "title": "Custom Name Catcher Batter Baseball Baseball Throw, Baseba - Design 12",
  "handle": "custom-name-catcher-batter-baseball-baseball-throw-baseba-design-12",
  "body_html": "<p>Celebrate your love for baseball with this cozy and custom-made blanket from Jeminise. Perfect for baseball players and fans alike, this personalized blanket makes a thoughtful gift for any occasion, ensuring warmth and cherished memories.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> A perfect gift for men and women, moms and dads, ideal for Valentine's, Mother's and Father's Day, and Christmas Day.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize with the name and number of your favorite baseball player to create a unique and special item.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Made from Sherpa and Fleece fabric with two layers of polyester, offering a super soft, lightweight, and comfortable experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) to suit your needs.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat for best results. Dries quickly and remains fluffy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Style:</strong> Features a dedicated Baseball Design, celebrating the spirit of the sport.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Constructed with Sherpa &amp; Fleece Fabric, and two layers of Polyester for durability and long-lasting color.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Design 02</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs (Custom Name and Number)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable, Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Sports</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Sport</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable: Wash separately in cold water and then either let them air dry without heat. Better to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
